{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國最高法院已開啓本年度10月會期，但蘋果與Epic Games之間持續多年的法律糾紛並未迎來最終裁決。根據美國最高法院最新公佈的信息，雙方將在2027年1月11日正式向最高法院陳述各自主張，而在此之前，相關爭議仍將在下級法院體系中繼續推進。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584826.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T06:42:33.633078+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T06:33:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T06:38:44.484281+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T06:38:44.484281+00:00","content_hash":"27168344c83280350fcf26aac5dc043432d3e6b0c7dcd1fa7c836049cdb58c07","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}